  "description": "Vintage Story using the dockerized-game-servers image. Docker image: ghcr.io/sudo-ivan/dockerized-game-servers/vintage-story:latest. Persistent data is stored under /home/container (mapped from the image data directory on startup). Default ports: 42420/tcp, 42420/udp",
